  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2250101",
      "subQuestName": "与清昼对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010101": {
            "id": "225010101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "嗯…这一句还是不妥，不妥。唉，说不得还是要去看看…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010102"
            ]
          },
          "225010102": {
            "id": "225010102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010103"
            ]
          },
          "225010103": {
            "id": "225010103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "您好您好，在下清昼，自诩诗客。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010104"
            ]
          },
          "225010104": {
            "id": "225010104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "最近我偶得妙诗一句，却始终不知道如何能续，思索至今，始终不得头绪…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010105"
            ]
          },
          "225010105": {
            "id": "225010105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "最近天有异象，众多陨石坠地，此类景观实在人间少有。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010106"
            ]
          },
          "225010106": {
            "id": "225010106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "我想，要是能去陨石近前一观，搜得些许灵感，那下一句诗说不定就能水到渠成…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010107"
            ]
          },
          "225010107": {
            "id": "225010107",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不，不太合适…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010108"
            ]
          },
          "225010108": {
            "id": "225010108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "不太合适？您这又是从何说起？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250102",
      "subQuestName": "劝说清昼远离陨石",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010201": {
            "id": "225010201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "您说的「不太合适」，到底是指什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010202"
            ]
          },
          "225010202": {
            "id": "225010202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "摸到陨石的话会陷入昏睡…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010203"
            ]
          },
          "225010203": {
            "id": "225010203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "唔，这件事我也有所耳闻，但如果只是近观一番，想必也没有什么大碍。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010204"
            ]
          },
          "225010204": {
            "id": "225010204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你能保证绝不摸陨石吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010205"
            ]
          },
          "225010205": {
            "id": "225010205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "这个…这个我心中自有分寸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250103",
      "subQuestName": "劝服1-1$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010301": {
            "id": "225010301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有更好的方法能观察陨石。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010302"
            ]
          },
          "225010302": {
            "id": "225010302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "更好的方法…哦，这么一说，我到近前去只见陨石，不见周围事物…确实有些狭隘了…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250104",
      "subQuestName": "劝服1-2$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010401": {
            "id": "225010401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "在这也能写诗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010402"
            ]
          },
          "225010402": {
            "id": "225010402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "这可不行，如果只是安居一隅，闭门造车，写的诗也只会是些无病呻吟的白烂话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250105",
      "subQuestName": "劝服1-3$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250106",
      "subQuestName": "劝服2-1$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010601": {
            "id": "225010601",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不必强求惊世骇俗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010602"
            ]
          },
          "225010602": {
            "id": "225010602",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "您这句话说得倒对，佳句本天成，妙手偶得之。但是，这句诗困扰我太久，我想快点接下去啊…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250107",
      "subQuestName": "劝服2-2$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010701": {
            "id": "225010701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "见了陨石也不一定有灵感…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010702"
            ]
          },
          "225010702": {
            "id": "225010702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "哈哈哈，您也是小看了我，如果我亲眼见得陨石，必定能出佳作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250108",
      "subQuestName": "劝服2-3$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010801": {
            "id": "225010801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "万一陷入昏睡…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010802"
            ]
          },
          "225010802": {
            "id": "225010802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "这你大可放心，我心中自有分寸。但是，触摸陨石就会陷入昏睡，那昏睡之人，又会梦到什么呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010803"
            ]
          },
          "225010803": {
            "id": "225010803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "真是让人好奇…咳咳！咳，我只是说说，你放心吧，我绝不会把自己置于险地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250109",
      "subQuestName": "劝服3-1$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225010901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225010901": {
            "id": "225010901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你确定能解决所有危险？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010902"
            ]
          },
          "225010902": {
            "id": "225010902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "我去的时候，自然会雇人与我同行，以防万一。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010903"
            ]
          },
          "225010903": {
            "id": "225010903",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "现在可难得雇到人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225010904"
            ]
          },
          "225010904": {
            "id": "225010904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "呃，这个…这个…这个倒真是个问题…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250110",
      "subQuestName": "劝服3-2$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011001": {
            "id": "225011001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有灵感也未必能出佳句。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011002"
            ]
          },
          "225011002": {
            "id": "225011002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "哈哈，非是自夸，清昼虽无大才，但坊间亦有不少诗句流传，您不必怀疑我的能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250111",
      "subQuestName": "劝服3-3$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011101": {
            "id": "225011101",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你原来写的就挺好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011102"
            ]
          },
          "225011102": {
            "id": "225011102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "您谬赞了，但清昼自诩诗客，如果久无新诗，实在有愧于心…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250124",
      "subQuestName": "保护环$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011901": {
            "id": "225011901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "您苦心劝说的好意，清昼心领。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011902"
            ]
          },
          "225011902": {
            "id": "225011902",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "至于是否前往陨石坠落之处，容我再思索一番…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250112",
      "subQuestName": "心情值判定成功$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011201": {
            "id": "225011201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "我思来想去，你的担心不无道理，我还是不去陨石旁边自找麻烦了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011202"
            ]
          },
          "225011202": {
            "id": "225011202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那就好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011203"
            ]
          },
          "225011203": {
            "id": "225011203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "况且，好诗未必一定以新奇词句见长，于细微处见博大胸怀才更妙。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011204"
            ]
          },
          "225011204": {
            "id": "225011204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "以花草等微小之物入诗，或许也能写出妙句，但世间咏花的诗文实在数量众多…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011205"
            ]
          },
          "225011205": {
            "id": "225011205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "唔，俗话说「旁观者清」，以你看来，何种花入诗合适？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2250113",
      "subQuestName": "心情值判定失败$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "225011301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "225011301": {
            "id": "225011301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "唔…我思来想去，陨石是难得一见的异象，还是去看看才好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011302"
            ]
          },
          "225011302": {
            "id": "225011302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011303"
            ]
          },
          "225011303": {
            "id": "225011303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "但是，如果我直接到陨石前近观，未免被陨石吸引了视线，只见陨石，不见周遭世界。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011304"
            ]
          },
          "225011304": {
            "id": "225011304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "「一叶障目」是诗客大敌。如果一开始就一味观察陨石，反而做不出好诗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011305"
            ]
          },
          "225011305": {
            "id": "225011305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "所以，我想要先远观陨石，概览周遭，然后再近前细观…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011306"
            ]
          },
          "225011306": {
            "id": "225011306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "然后…这个，呃，路上魔物众多，我又暂时没法雇到人与我同去…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011307"
            ]
          },
          "225011307": {
            "id": "225011307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "不知道您愿不愿意帮我个忙，去扫清了堵路的那些魔物？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011309",
              "225011311"
            ]
          },
          "225011309": {
            "id": "225011309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "好！好好好，那就劳烦您了。"
          },
          "225011311": {
            "id": "225011311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "这个…我，我答应你就是。哎呀，既然知道触摸陨石就会昏睡不醒，我又怎么会自涉险地…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011312"
            ]
          },
          "225011312": {
            "id": "225011312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "不过…不知道那些触摸陨石后昏睡之人，会做什么样的梦…我还真是挺好奇…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "225011313"
            ]
          },
          "225011313": {
            "id": "225011313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "清昼",
            "text": "咳咳，咳！那个，我开玩笑而已，请您快去扫清魔物吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
